---
description: Authentication flows, routes, and helpers
---

## Auth Pages
- Login: `app/auth/login/page.tsx` using `components/login-form.tsx`
- Sign-up: `app/auth/sign-up/page.tsx` using `components/sign-up-form.tsx`
- Forgot password: `app/auth/forgot-password/page.tsx` using `components/forgot-password-form.tsx`
- Update password: `app/auth/update-password/page.tsx` using `components/update-password-form.tsx`
- OAuth callback/handler: `app/auth/oauth/*`
- Confirm, error, success routes under `app/auth/*`

## Helpers
- Current user utilities: `lib/auth/get-current-user.ts`
- Middleware: [middleware.ts](mdc:middleware.ts) for route protection when needed

## UI Helpers
- User avatar/name hooks: `hooks/use-current-user-image.ts`, `hooks/use-current-user-name.ts`
- Menus and states: `components/user-menu.tsx`, `components/guest-menu.tsx`, `components/header.tsx`

